# fixedbugs, defect 360, lane cli12, 2026-10-05.
#
# Beside `fixedbugs-360-a-header-that-does-not-compile`: the group's header
# compiles, and a header it includes does not. clang's error names the second
# header, which no group names; the include stack above it names the group's,
# and the diagnostic is told on that group with the include clang followed.

extern "fixedbugs-360-outer.h"  #~ ffi_header_refused
    function four() -> i64

function main()
    print(four())
